# Phase 3d: executive summary (optional).
#
# Free-tier Groq API key, used by app/api/summary/route.ts to generate a
# short natural-language executive summary from the already-computed
# aggregate numbers (never raw data). Get a free key at
# https://console.groq.com/keys -- no credit card required.
#
# If this is left unset, the "Generate executive summary" button still
# works: it falls back to a templated (non-AI) summary built from the same
# numbers, with no error shown to the user.
GROQ_API_KEY=
